From bae2918118b281200be06e0850ed1cbadf17eb0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oracl <oracl@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:09:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add read_evm_call (interface 5) and read_utxo_tx (interface
 6) services

read_evm_call: eth_call at a finalized block, pinned with EIP-1898, fixed
sender and gas, multi-provider byte agreement; reuses EVM_RPC_URLS_<chainId>.
read_utxo_tx: one output of a confirmed Dogecoin / Bitcoin / Litecoin tx via
the nodes' shared JSON-RPC (txindex=1), exact Decimal amounts, depth checked
on every node. Both stdlib-only Python with mock nodes and selftests (29 and
33 checks). Node config, docker-compose and example_env register the slots.
Requires the matching qubic/core interfaces (EvmCallRead.h, UtxoTxRead.h).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
